  "goal": "Count things and people, ask 'how many / how much', give your age and use ordinals (first to tenth).",
  "intro": "Learn the numbers 0–100 from the **Numbers** chart in this course — Malayalam numbers are fairly regular after 20: tens + -ത്തി- + unit (ഇരുപത്തിയൊന്ന് 21, മുപ്പത്തിരണ്ട് 32). Large amounts are counted in **lakhs** (ലക്ഷം, 100,000) and **crores** (കോടി, 10 million), not millions.\n\nThis unit is about *using* numbers: how many, how much, how old, and which one in order.",
